From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wai Chung <hello@ternii.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] llama: MoE expert cache backed by the model file
 (LLAMA_MOE_SSD=1, default off)

Keeps routed expert weights in the GGUF file and reads only the experts
the router selects into a fixed bank of slots in GPU-visible memory, with
LRU replacement per layout group. Output is unchanged versus the fully
resident model (raw-logit gate). For machines whose memory cannot hold all
experts. Budget: LLAMA_MOE_CACHE_MIB. Stats: LLAMA_MOE_STATS=path.
